### ==========================================
### PaperAI 多 Agent 论文写作系统 — HTTP 接口测试
### 使用前请确保后端已启动（端口 8081）
### 可在 VS Code 中安装 REST Client 插件运行
### ==========================================

### ==================== 1. 健康检查 ====================

### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8081/api/paper/health

### ==================== 2. 全流程论文写作 ====================

### 2.1 完整论文写作（4个章节，最多2轮审稿）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/paper/write
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "深度学习在医疗影像分割中的应用",
  "description": "探索基于U-Net和Transformer的医学图像分割方法，对比不同架构的性能差异",
  "keywords": "深度学习,医疗影像,图像分割,U-Net,Transformer",
  "sections": ["摘要", "引言", "相关工作", "方法", "实验", "结论"],
  "maxReviewRounds": 3
}

### 2.2 简洁版论文写作（使用默认章节）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/paper/write
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "基于大语言模型的多Agent协作框架研究",
  "keywords": "LLM,Multi-Agent,协作框架",
  "maxReviewRounds": 2
}

### 2.3 带详细要求的论文写作
POST http://localhost:8081/api/paper/write
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "联邦学习在隐私保护中的应用",
  "description": "研究联邦学习在医疗数据隐私保护中的关键技术挑战和解决方案",
  "keywords": "联邦学习,隐私保护,医疗数据,安全聚合",
  "sections": ["引言", "背景知识", "方法论", "实验分析", "结论"],
  "maxReviewRounds": 3,
  "requirements": "1. 需要引用近三年顶会论文\n2. 重点分析差分隐私和安全聚合技术\n3. 包含与其他方法的实验对比"
}

### ==================== 3. 单步研究（文献调研） ====================

### 3.1 基础调研
POST http://localhost:8081/api/paper/research
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Graph Neural Networks for Drug Discovery",
  "keywords": "GNN,药物发现,分子图"
}

### 3.2 详细调研
POST http://localhost:8081/api/paper/research
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "强化学习在机器人控制中的应用",
  "description": "调查基于深度强化学习的机器人操作技能学习方法",
  "keywords": "强化学习,机器人控制,DRL,模仿学习",
  "requirements": "重点关注2024-2026年的最新进展，对比model-based和model-free方法的优劣"
}

### ==================== 4. 单 Agent 调试接口 ====================

### 4.1 调用导师 Agent — 选题评估
POST http://localhost:8081/api/agent/SUPERVISOR/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "量子机器学习在金融风控中的应用",
  "description": "探索量子神经网络在信用评分和欺诈检测中的潜力"
}

### 4.2 调用研究员 Agent — 文献调研
POST http://localhost:8081/api/agent/RESEARCHER/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "边缘计算中的联邦学习优化",
  "keywords": "边缘计算,联邦学习,通信优化",
  "description": "研究在资源受限的边缘设备上高效执行联邦学习的方法"
}

### 4.3 调用写作 Agent — 撰写章节
POST http://localhost:8081/api/agent/WRITER/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "对比学习在视觉表征中的应用",
  "sections": ["引言", "方法"],
  "description": "撰写论文引言和方法部分"
}

### 4.4 调用审稿 Agent
POST http://localhost:8081/api/agent/REVIEWER/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "测试论文",
  "description": "审阅论文内容"
}

### 4.5 调用润色 Agent
POST http://localhost:8081/api/agent/POLISHER/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "测试润色",
  "description": "润色论文语言"
}

### ==================== 5. 流式接口 ====================

### 5.1 流式研究结果（SSE）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/paper/research/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Transformer在时间序列预测中的应用"
}

### ==================== 6. 异常场景测试 ====================

### 6.1 空标题（测试参数校验）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/paper/write
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "",
  "sections": ["引言"]
}

### 6.2 无效 JSON
POST http://localhost:8081/api/paper/write
Content-Type: application/json

invalid json

### 6.3 缺少必填字段
POST http://localhost:8081/api/paper/write
Content-Type: application/json

### ==================== 7. 论文管理 CRUD（持久化后可用） ====================

### 7.1 论文列表
GET http://localhost:8081/api/paper/list

### 7.2 论文详情
GET http://localhost:8081/api/paper/1

### 7.3 论文关联的 Agent 任务链路
GET http://localhost:8081/api/paper/1/tasks

### 7.4 删除论文
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/paper/1


POST http://localhost:8081/api/paper/write
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "深度学习在医疗影像分割中的应用",
  "description": "探索基于U-Net和Transformer的医学图像分割方法",
  "keywords": "深度学习,医疗影像,图像分割,U-Net,Transformer",
  "sections": ["摘要", "引言", "相关工作", "方法", "实验", "结论"],
  "maxReviewRounds": 2
}
